cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the accompanying bachelor dissertation (see references below)."
title: "Interior Ballistics Multi-Objective Optimization (内弹道多目标优化设计)"
abstract: >-
  MATLAB implementation accompanying the bachelor dissertation
  "Development and Practice of Ballistic Design Software"
  (弹道设计软件开发及实践). The code solves the classical multi-perforated
  propellant interior ballistics ODE system, determines the propellant web
  thickness by bisection to match the design chamber pressure, and performs
  a Pareto-based multi-objective optimization of the charge utilisation
  coefficient and the web thickness with a dynamic penalty function.
